          "ordinal": 1,
          "tag": "section",
          "role": null,
          "accessibleName": null,
          "selector": "#how-we-work",
          "text": {
            "value": "How we work Manuscripts arrive by post. We read them away from a screen, answer every one, and take on two a year. An accepted book is edited over eight months, set in metal for the title pages, and printed in runs of nine hundred. Nothing is reprinted. When a run is gone the book stays gone, which keeps the shelf honest and the workshop quiet.",
            "length": 346,
            "truncated": false
